-## Approach
-
-1. **Phase 1 — Bulk deletes**: `git rm -rf skills/{skill-evolver,simplify-skill,show-skill,compress-skill,create-skill,umbrella}` and `git rm scripts/test-{post-scaffold-hints,prepare-description,parse-args}.{sh,md}`.
-2. **Phase 2 — Runtime configs**: edit `.claude/settings.json`, `agent-lint.toml`, `Makefile` (targets + `.PHONY` + shard lists). Verify `make test-harness-shards-coverage` passes after Makefile edits.
-3. **Phase 3 — Docs**: edit `README.md`, `docs/skills.md`, `docs/installation-and-setup.md`, `docs/configuration-and-permissions.md`, `docs/linting.md`, `docs/workflow-lifecycle.md`.
-4. **Phase 4 — Shared + cross-skill refs**: edit `skills/shared/{voting-protocol,subskill-invocation,skill-design-principles}.md`, `skills/review/SKILL.md`, `skills/issue/scripts/{create-one.sh,create-one.md,parse-input.md}`, `skills/alias/scripts/resolve-target.{sh,md}`, `SECURITY.md`.
-5. **Phase 5 — Test harnesses + reproducer**: edit `scripts/{test-anti-halt-banners.sh,test-review-structure.sh,blocker-helpers.sh,repro-claude-p-edit-permissions.sh,repro-claude-p-edit-permissions.md}`.
-6. **Phase 6 — Verify**: run `make lint` (shellcheck, markdownlint, jsonlint, actionlint, agent-lint, agnix, gitleaks, trufflehog) and `make test-harnesses` (or at minimum `make test-harness-shards-coverage` + the harnesses that test files we modified). Manual smoke test of `/issue` (single mode + label probe path) and `/alias`.
